{"type":"user","uuid":"3298c7e6-c779-4e6e-93c0-88f859d0bba2","session_id":"94dad33d-d8c6-43a5-bcb7-d8518837aad1","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-abc72d1ffe5ecaed","is_error":false,"content":"package swati4star.createpdf.util;\n\nimport android.app.Activity;\nimport android.support.design.widget.BottomSheetBehavior;\n\nimport swati4star.createpdf.interfaces.BottomSheetPopulate;\n\npublic class BottomSheetUtils  {\n\n    private Activity mContext;\n\n    public BottomSheetUtils(Activity context) {\n        this.mContext = context;\n    }\n\n    public void showHideSheet(BottomSheetBehavior sheetBehavior) {\n        if (sheetBehavior.getState() != BottomSheetBehavior.STATE_EXPANDED) {\n            sheetBehavior.setState(BottomSheetBehavior.STATE_EXPANDED);\n        } else {\n            sheetBehavior.setState(BottomSheetBehavior.STATE_COLLAPSED);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void populateBottomSheetWithPDFs(BottomSheetPopulate listener) {\n        new PopulateBottomSheetList(listener, new DirectoryUtils(mContext)).execute();\n    }\n\n}\n"}]}}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"fd8b771c-4d7a-45a8-a38f-9c92ebb124b9","session_id":"94dad33d-d8c6-43a5-bcb7-d8518837aad1","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"fd8b771c-4d7a-45a8-a38f-9c92ebb124b9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture of the bug and the fix:\n\n1. The bottom sheet has `app:behavior_hideable=\"true\"` in its XML layout\n2. Each fragment that uses the bottom sheet has a `BottomSheetBehavior` reference\n3. In `MainActivity.onBackPressed()`, when on a non-Home fragment, it unconditionally navigates to HomeFragment without checking if the bottom sheet is open/expanded\n\nThe fix should be: in `onBackPressed()`, check if any bottom sheet is expanded, and if so, collapse it first instead of navigating away.\n\nHowever, the bottom sheet is inside each fragment's layout, not directly accessible from MainActivity. Let me check one of the fragments to see how they manage the bottom sheet.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
